Namespace-qualified selectors (`svg|circle`, `*|a`, `|a`, `svg|*`,
`[xlink|href]`) parse and are extracted verbatim.

  $ cat > dune-project << EOF
  > (lang dune 3.10)
  > EOF

  $ cat > dune << EOF
  > (executable
  >  (name input)
  >  (libraries styled-ppx.native)
  >  (preprocess (pps styled-ppx)))
  > EOF

  $ dune build

  $ dune describe pp ./input.re | sed '1,/^];$/d'
  [@css
    (
      "._a_zh70v5w9wvj svg|circle{fill:red;}",
      "_a_zh70v5w9wvj",
      "0,1,1 & svg|circle",
      "212",
      1,
      true,
    )
  ];
  [@css
    (
      "._a_jxqpf4ekoom *|a{color:blue;}",
      "_a_jxqpf4ekoom",
      "0,1,1 & *|a",
      "158",
      1,
      true,
    )
  ];
  [@css
    (
      "._a_noi564e8hmn |a{color:green;}",
      "_a_noi564e8hmn",
      "0,1,1 & |a",
      "158",
      1,
      true,
    )
  ];
  [@css
    (
      "._a_bkgso4es6rf svg|*{color:pink;}",
      "_a_bkgso4es6rf",
      "0,1,1 & svg|*",
      "158",
      1,
      true,
